Acting Representative to the UN Economic and Social Council
New York, New York
AS DELIVERED
Thank you, Mr. President.
On behalf of the United States, I would like to extend our thanks to the co-facilitators for their efforts on this resolution. The United States strongly supports sensible environmental protections.
However, the focus of the UN Ocean Conference series on the implementation of Sustainable Development Goal 14 is at odds with the U.S. position on the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development and the SDGs.
As previously stated, the United States considers the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development and the Sustainable Development Goals a form of soft global governance.
For this reason, we are voting “no” on this resolution.
Thank you.
